Z||000013||Oreif||07-19-2000||03:17 AM||||Haze, Get your springs yet? When are we putting them on? We could probably set it up to do yours and Coyote's at the same time. He has an air compressor, the pickle fork, and a torch (if needed) to speed things up. Should take us less than 4 hours to do both cars. <BR>If you belong to any Fiero club the Fiero Store will give you 10% off your order! <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000014||dogtired||07-19-2000||05:18 AM||||GREAT Service, and a discount to boot  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I have ordered several parts, several times and to be quite honest, I do not remember how long they took to get here, but it never was more than a week?? I do remember one morning I called to request their latest catalog and the next afternoon it showed up in the mail! Now thats what I call service. <P>Wish I had known about the Discount?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> I Will catch them next time.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||6
